      {
        "Id": "c88aa4f24cc6430fabd7ff6e6ad01f0e",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  CAD2BIM RCP + CEILING COLOURS + SCHEDULE\n1. Open the RCP (or its sheet).  Local file only - Dynamo never syncs to central.\n2. Check groups 2-8.  Group 1: Run = True, press Run (bottom left).\n3. Every ceiling TYPE gets ONE number + colour: C01 Ceiling 1, C02 Ceiling 2 ...\n   The RCP, colour plan, both legends, schedule and labels all use the same list.\n4. Read RESULT.  Re-run any time - everything is updated in place.  Revit Undo removes the run.",
